client/web/sodium.js

    libsodium.js - a JavaScript/WebAssembly build of libsodium.
    Copyright (c) Frank Denis and the libsodium.js contributors.
    Licensed under the ISC License.
    https://github.com/jedisct1/libsodium.js

    Vendored rather than loaded from a CDN on purpose: the browser
    client performs the decryption, so no third-party origin may enter
    the security-critical trust set. The file is the upstream minified
    build, unmodified. Minification strips the upstream licence header,
    which is why the attribution lives here instead.

Dart and Flutter package dependencies are resolved by `pub` and are not
vendored in this repository. Their licences are recorded in
`client/pubspec.lock` and in the local pub cache.
